      "title": "06. 代码图谱ssh版",
      "body": "图谱切片\n代码图谱ssh版，，新一代编程agent的核心，，争议状态，做ssh版就等于先否决cli版 \n代码图谱cli版\n函数间的通信树\n\n把 Elixir 源码按函数切成独立块存入 SQLite，再把块编号和行号关联到图谱节点。\n读写前检查节点和块的归属，逐块返回结果，并区分块操作成功与图谱写回成功。",
      "proposer": "trlstdin",
      "assignee": "",
      "host": "",
      "finisher": "",
      "column": 4,
      "rank": 15360,
      "createdAt": "2026-11-07T06:14:09.573Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-11-09T11:10:24.364Z",
      "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/alistrode/elixir-sqlite-chunker",
      "personalRepositoryUrl": "https://github.com/trlstdin/rororororo/tree/projects/elixir-sqlite-chunker",
      "historyNumber": 6,
      "pinned": true,
      "columnNumber": 2
    },
    {
